WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.079
<v NARRATOR>You're Maya, and it's the morning after a new-member event.

00:00:03.079 --> 00:00:04.749
<v NARRATOR>You open the chapter group chat.

00:00:04.749 --> 00:00:10.176
<v NARRATOR>There's a video of your little being made to down drinks and recite chapter history while sisters laugh.

00:00:10.176 --> 00:00:11.950
<v NARRATOR>Last year you were the new member.

00:00:11.950 --> 00:00:13.411
<v NARRATOR>This fall she's your little.

00:00:13.411 --> 00:00:16.699
<v NARRATOR>She's fine, but she's embarrassed, and she won't talk about it.
